<title>FRANCE: Two ships loading flour in Rouen, one more due.</title>
<headline>Two ships loading flour in Rouen, one more due.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two ships are loading 29,000 tonnes of flour in Rouen for export to Cuba and Yemen, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>One more ship was expected in port very shortly to load an unspecified tonnage of flour destined for west Africa, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
